###

### SCENARIO 4: High-value order with automatic payment retry - MacBook Pro x3
### Grand total ~1,800,675 LKR (>= step-up threshold). First charge is held for
### bank authorization; the orchestrator retries automatically => COMPLETED.
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "customerId": "CUST-CORP-01",
    "branchId": "BRANCH-COL",
    "items": [
        { "itemId": "MACBOOK-PRO-001", "quantity": 3 }
    ],
    "shippingAddress": {
        "line1": "88 Reid Avenue",
        "city": "Colombo",
        "area": "Colombo 07",
        "country": "Sri Lanka"
    },
    "paymentDetails": { "paymentMethod": "CARD", "currency": "LKR" }
}

###

### SCENARIO 5: Insufficient stock - MacBook Pro x15 from Colombo (only 10) => INSUFFICIENT_STOCK
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
